  "confidence": 0.7,
  "anomalies": [
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["C5"],
      "pins": ["U5.11"],
      "nets": ["Net-(U5-SS)"],
      "observed": "C5, the capacitor on the TPS2121RUXR power mux soft-start pin (U5 pin 11, net Net-(U5-SS)), has value \"10pF\" (LCSC C1710), and the SPICE deck also lists it as 10p.",
      "expected": "The specification states the SS pin uses a 10 nF capacitor (C5) for soft-start; 10 pF is 1000x too small.",
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "spec", "quote": "`SS` (pin 11) has a 10 nF cap (`C5`) for soft-start."},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(comp (ref \"C5\")\n      (value \"10pF\")"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(net (code \"29\") (name \"Net-(U5-SS)\") (class \"Default\")\n      (node (ref \"C5\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"U5\") (pin \"11\") (pinfunction \"SS\") (pintype \"passive\")))"},
        {"source": "spice", "quote": "C5 Net-_U5-SS_ 0 10p"}
      ],
      "impact": "The power mux output slew rate on VBUS is set ~1000x faster than designed, removing the intended soft-start ramp and its inrush-current limiting at power-up and at input switchover (12 V barrel jack vs USB 5 V).",
      "confidence": 0.7
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design matches the specification except for the power-mux soft-start capacitor C5, which is 10 pF where the spec calls for 10 nF (a 1000x value error that would eliminate the intended VBUS soft-start ramp); no other deviations from the described power, MCU, thermocouple, heater or fan-tach architecture were found."
}

